  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: neethi 3.2.2.rhlw-00006",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released org.apache.neethi:neethi 3.2.2.rhlw-00006 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-66142, CVE-2026-66143, and CVE-2026-66144.\n\nCVE-2026-66142: Apache Neethi: Uncontrolled recursion in policy processing\n\nCVE-2026-66143: Apache Neethi: Missing global alternative-output budget across policy computation paths\n\nCVE-2026-66144: Apache Neethi: Remote PolicyReference fetch lacks resource bounds\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for org.apache.neethi:neethi 3.2.2 from Maven Central.",
